  <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>

  <p>Last updated: September 8, 2026</p>

  <h2>About FunChat</h2>
  <p>
    FunChat is a camera-based application that allows users to
    use their device camera to create and enjoy visual content.
  </p>

  <h2>Camera Permission</h2>
  <p>
    FunChat requests access to your device camera so that you can
    use the camera features provided by the application.
    Camera access is used only when you use camera-related features.
  </p>

  <h2>Photos and Videos</h2>
  <p>
    If you choose to capture or save photos or videos using FunChat,
    the application may require the appropriate device permissions.
  </p>

  <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
  <p>
    FunChat does not require access to your camera unless you choose
    to use camera-related features. We do not claim ownership of
    content you create using the application.
  </p>

  <h2>Third-Party Services</h2>
  <p>
    FunChat may use third-party services to provide camera features
    and visual effects.
  </p>

  <h2>Children's Privacy</h2>
  <p>
    FunChat is not specifically directed to children under 13 in
    the United States.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    If you have questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact
    the FunChat developer.
  </p>

